 INTERNAL Error de Gemini 


 POST /v1/generate → 404. Contrato: iic3103.llm.v1.Llm/Generate . 



 llm.proto 
 Servicio iic3103.llm.v1.Llm · RPC unary Generate 
 Cargando proto… 



 Local: localhost:50051 insecure. Producción: host :443 con TLS.
 Env: LLM_GRPC_TARGET + LLM_GRPC_TLS=true .


 Copiado 

 const local = location.hostname === "localhost" || location.hostname === "127.0.0.1";
 const target = local ? "localhost:50051" : `dns:///${location.host}:443`;
 const tls = local ? "false (insecure)" : "true";
 const protoUrl = `${location.origin}/proto/llm.proto`;
 document.getElementById("grpc-target").textContent = target;
 document.getElementById("tls-flag").textContent = tls;
 document.getElementById("py-cmd").textContent =
`curl -fsSL ${protoUrl} -o llm.proto
python3 -m pip install grpcio grpcio-tools
python3 -m grpc_tools.protoc -I. --python_out=. --grpc_python_out=. llm.proto`;
 document.getElementById("node-cmd").textContent =
`curl -fsSL ${protoUrl} -o llm.proto
npm i @grpc/grpc-js @grpc/proto-loader
# protoLoader.loadSync("./llm.proto")`;
 document.getElementById("copyTarget").onclick = async () => {
 await navigator.clipboard.writeText(target);
 const t = document.getElementById("toast");
 t.style.display = "block";
 setTimeout(() => { t.style.display = "none"; }, 1200);
 };
 fetch("/proto/llm.proto")
 .then((r) => r.text())
 .then((txt) => { document.getElementById("proto-preview").textContent = txt; })
 .catch(() => { document.getElementById("proto-preview").textContent = "No se pudo cargar el proto."; });




{"status":"ok"}

